    "notes_general": "Parking InformationSpectator Parking: Free spectator parking will be available in the main lots south and east of the stadium.Group Bus Parking: Group bus parking will be available in the lot south of the middle school, off of North Oak St. following 31st Avenue N.Important InformationSpectator Entry and Re-entry: Spectators will enter through the main gate to the right of the stands entering from the main parking lot (southeast side of the stadium). The box office will be located at the main gate. To re-enter the stadium, spectators will need to obtain a wristband and have their ticket on hand. Concessions: Concessions will be located inside the stadium. There will also be a Smoothie food truck inside the stadium. Each will accept cash or card, but card payments are preferred.Souvenirs: All souvenirs will be located under the spectator stands. Clear Bag Policy: Doug Shaw Memorial Stadium will have a clear bag policy in effect for this event, restricting the size and style bags that will be permitted within the venue. All bags are subject to search by event staff and security. For security and efficiency, all attendees are encouraged to keep all items to a minimum.",
